{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18304130","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18304130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1830413001:1":{"text":"就是那个，雾咒湖的诅咒传说啊！传说只要将所恨之人的名字刻在石头上，丢进湖里，对方就会受到诅咒。","source_cn":"就是那个，雾咒湖的诅咒传说啊！传说只要将所恨之人的名字...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04BF64DB78F86DC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830413002:0":{"text":"那都是骗小孩的把戏，你都多大了，还信这个？","source_cn":"那都是骗小孩的把戏，你都多大了，还信这个？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86BB92BBE8B7C697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830413003:1":{"text":"不是啊！我真的遇到了！我之前也不信邪，就在石头上刻上了自己的名字丢到湖里……","source_cn":"不是啊！我真的遇到了！我之前也不信邪，就在石头上刻上了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96225691568F6118","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830413004:1":{"text":"结果昨晚我就听到自己的窗户一直被什么东西拍！出去看又没有鬼！","source_cn":"结果昨晚我就听到自己的窗户一直被什么东西拍！出去看又没有鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA41231B4342AA74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830413005:1":{"text":"这很恐怖不是吗？我一定是被诅咒了！","source_cn":"这很恐怖不是吗？我一定是被诅咒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC311FF2B6C95284A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit